style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1200277/description_a0cf5d24-b729-4cff-8eb2-623e67c37226.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">文件名稱：</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">下載名為</span> \"H6\" 的文件</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1200277/description_0626bbd1-0d64-479c-ba37-30c05f33629e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">只需在客戶端安裝即可；它在所有服務器上均可使用。無需也在服務器上安裝。</span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1200277/description_0626bbd1-0d64-479c-ba37-30c05f33629e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></strong></span></strong> <strong>某些版本中有鍵位更改</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1200277/description_0626bbd1-0d64-479c-ba37-30c05f33629e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">按<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">\"F6,F7,F9\"</span>鍵顯示半徑5格內玩家的生命值 / 再次按<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">\"F6,F7,F9\"</span>鍵隱藏</span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cq32XIj.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"424\" height=\"239\"></div>\n<h4><strong><img src